WEBVTT

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.833
-[blows whistle]
-Twenty-eight!

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:11.250
Andersen, tripping!

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:15.416
-[blows whistle]
-Twenty-eight!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Andersen, tripping!

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.208
[rewinding]

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.541
[fast-forwarding]

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.791
-[blows whistle]
-Twenty-eight!

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:24.875
-Andersen, tripping!
-[sighs]

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:29.000
[teacher]
I expected better, Riley.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.208
-[fast-forwarding]
-[Joy pants, stutters]

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.708
That's not...

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.333
[stutters, pants]

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:40.708
-What...
-[memories overlapping]

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.666
Come on, please.

00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.625
What am I missing?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:01.000
[Riley distorted]
I'm a good person.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.750
[Sense of Self warbles]

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.625
Joy...

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:12.666
so what do we do now?

00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:22.750
I don't know.

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:26.791
I don't know
how to stop Anxiety.

00:01:29.583 --> 00:01:31.041
Maybe we can't.

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:35.833
Maybe this is what happens
when you grow up.

00:01:37.041 --> 00:01:39.291
You feel less joy.

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:47.583
But I do know this.

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:52.916
Riley will never be herself

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.000
if we don't get this
back to Headquarters.

00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:56.666
Fast.

00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.208
How?

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.250
[blows whistle]

00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:04.583
Have a good game, Riley.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.083
You too.

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:09.875
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:02:11.666 --> 00:02:12.916
[players grunting]

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.000
[Riley grunting]

00:02:14.541 --> 00:02:15.541
[player] Whoa!

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:18.500
Yes! Go, go, go!

00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.875
[Dani] Riley, I'm open.
Pass it, pass it!

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.333
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:28.500
[Riley grunts]

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.416
-[buzzer sounds]
-Yeah, Michigan!

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.291
Leave some
for the rest of us, huh?

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:34.458
Yes! One down, two to go.

00:02:35.041 --> 00:02:36.708
[Disgust] Okay, so how do we
get our Sense of Self

00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:38.500
from here to there?

00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:40.541
[Anger groans]

00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:44.250
I have an idea,
but I really don't like it.

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.208
Anger, Riley needs us.

00:02:48.375 --> 00:02:51.041
Oh, Pouchy!

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:52.291
[echoing]

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.333
Well, what are you
waiting for? Say the words!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.541
Oh, Pouchy!

00:02:58.625 --> 00:02:59.750
[echoing]

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:05.041
[♪ amusing music plays]

00:03:05.125 --> 00:03:07.208
Hi, everybody. I'm Pouchy!

00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:08.291
We know.

00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:09.958
Pouchy, we need to
get back to Headquarters.

00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:11.666
Do you have anything
that can help us?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.500
I have lots of items.

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:15.791
Which one do you think
will work the best?

00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:17.208
A roll of tape,

00:03:17.291 --> 00:03:19.458
-a rubber ducky...
-[Anger] No time!

00:03:19.541 --> 00:03:21.083
-[Pouchy gagging]
-Huh?

00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:22.166
Hmm.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.250
Seriously, Pouchy? Dynamite?

00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:26.291
Don't you have, like,
a jetpack or a plane

00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:27.750
or something
that's going to help us?

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:29.625
What do you think,
I have everything in here?

00:03:29.791 --> 00:03:31.250
I offered you
the rubber ducky,

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:32.333
I offered you the tape.

00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:33.416
I know what to do.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.583
But we're gonna need
a lot more dynamite.

00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:38.750
You know what? Good luck...
[gagging]

00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:40.125
[players shouting
indistinctly]

00:03:42.125 --> 00:03:43.583
[Anxiety] Come on, Riley.
Get the puck!

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.291
Take it, take it!

00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:48.708
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:03:48.791 --> 00:03:49.875
[Riley grunting]

00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:51.583
Michigan, what are you doing?

00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:53.875
We're on the same team!

00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:56.375
[panting]

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.250
[Riley grunts]

00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:00.541
[buzzer sounds]

00:04:00.625 --> 00:04:01.625
Yes!

00:04:02.416 --> 00:04:04.625
Well, Dani might be
a little mad at us,

00:04:04.791 --> 00:04:06.625
but they'll all forgive us
when we make the team.

00:04:06.791 --> 00:04:09.208
Come on, Riley. One more goal.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.500
[Disgust] Uh... Hold on, Joy.
We're gonna

00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:17.291
-blow up this cliff?
-Yep!

00:04:17.458 --> 00:04:19.458
And then
we'll ride an avalanche

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:20.958
of bad memories
back to Headquarters?

00:04:21.041 --> 00:04:22.041
Yeah!

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:23.666
And how do we
keep the bad memories

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.166
from forming bad beliefs?

00:04:25.541 --> 00:04:26.750
I don't know.

00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:30.541
Um, yeah! What could go wrong?
I'm in!

00:04:30.708 --> 00:04:31.708
Ready?

00:04:31.791 --> 00:04:32.875
-For Riley.
-Let's do it.

00:04:32.958 --> 00:04:34.833
Here we come, Riley.

00:04:40.541 --> 00:04:41.541
[explosion]

00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:43.458
[rumbling]

00:04:43.541 --> 00:04:46.250
[♪ thrilling music playing]

00:04:48.708 --> 00:04:49.708
Jump on!

00:04:50.416 --> 00:04:51.416
[all grunt]

00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:53.041
[all screaming]

00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:03.875
[grunting]

00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:09.375
[screams]

00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:14.666
[Riley grunts]

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.208
-Come on!
-[grunts]

00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:17.958
Aw, man!

00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:19.583
[Riley grunts]

00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:21.208
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:05:21.291 --> 00:05:23.041
[Anxiety] You have to score!

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:24.583
[players shouting]

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.000
[both grunt]

00:05:27.166 --> 00:05:28.833
[Grace exclaims]

00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:31.125
[Riley grunts,
groans in frustration]

00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:32.375
[blows whistle]

00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:35.458
Andersen,
penalty box, two minutes.

00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:36.708
No!

00:05:37.166 --> 00:05:38.791
Grace, are you okay?

00:05:39.291 --> 00:05:40.291
[panting]

00:05:42.791 --> 00:05:43.916
We hurt Grace.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.708
It all happened so fast.
I didn't even see her.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.708
[Riley panting]

00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:54.791
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:56.458
Oh, no. What did I do?

00:05:56.541 --> 00:05:58.666
[breathing heavily]

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.750
No, no.

00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:02.041
I can fix it, I can fix it.

00:06:03.041 --> 00:06:04.041
[heart palpitating]

00:06:05.125 --> 00:06:06.916
[memories clattering]

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.750
[Sense of Self warbling]

00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:21.083
[gasps]

00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:22.291
[grunting]

00:06:30.083 --> 00:06:31.083
[grunts]

00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:36.333
[Disgust gasping]

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.666
[Joy grunts, gasps]

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.208
[coughing]

00:06:41.541 --> 00:06:43.375
[teacher]
I expected better, Riley.

00:06:44.291 --> 00:06:45.500
Wait... No!

00:06:46.541 --> 00:06:48.000
[grunts] Come on.

00:06:49.291 --> 00:06:50.708
[Riley echoing]
I'm not good enough.

00:06:51.416 --> 00:06:52.416
Come on, Riley.

00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:53.875
Get it together.

00:06:54.041 --> 00:06:55.458
[Anxiety] Come on, Riley,
get it together.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.166
-I'm not good enough.
-[palpitations intensify]

00:06:58.375 --> 00:07:00.375
You have to score, Riley!

00:07:00.458 --> 00:07:01.500
Or this will all

00:07:01.583 --> 00:07:02.625
-have been for nothing!
-[whooshing]

00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:04.750
Anxiety, you're putting
too much pressure on her.

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:05.833
[Envy grunts]

